              "description": "Bind a part dimension to an exact project measurement OR an accepted physical space-measurement snapshot. Never copy a room snapshot into this project to fake source identity. Read physical_space_measurements and use its id and space_revision. The server supplies mm; keep original truth classes. Unbound dimensions remain design choices.",
              "items": {
